        Quest("CH2-149",2,149,"Reconnaissance of the Free Mine",category="Valley of Mines - Castle",giver="Garond",location="Valley of Mines - Castle",prerequisites="Have already investigated the mining camps as part of Garond's ore report.",summary="Investigate the former Free Mine for Garond, recover access, and eliminate the orc commander.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Talk to Garond about the former New Camp Free Mine and agree to scout it.","Visit the Free Mine entrance and return to report its current condition.","Defeat the orc Agrok near the blocked winch and take his key to open the mine.","Explore inside and defeat the orc commander Var-Ugor near the smelter.","Return to Garond after the commander is dead."),reward="Staged XP rewards, including 200 XP scouting and 3,500 XP plus 1,000 gold at final turn-in, according to the April 2026 guide.",warnings="https://rpgrussia.com/threads/razvedka-svobodnoj-shaxty.66949/",searchTags=listOf("reconnaissance of the free mine","valley of mines - castle","local quest giver in valley of mines - castle")),
        Quest("CH2-150",2,150,"Missing in Action",category="Valley of Mines - Castle",giver="Garond",location="Valley of Mines - Castle",prerequisites="Chapter 2; complete earlier quests in the same area/faction if the dialogue is not yet available.",summary="Find out what happened to Wenzel's and Albert's paladin detachments.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Ask Garond about the missing groups under Albert and Wenzel.","Find Albert's camp below Netbek's forest camp and report to Garond.","Ask Jergan at Fajeth's camp and Talbin above Cavalorn's hut about Wenzel's group.","Learn that Wenzel was captured by orcs, then speak to Garond about freeing the prisoners.","Earn access to the Orc Mine through Ur-Thrall in Orc City, complete the required mine questline, and free Wenzel.","Return to Garond with news of both groups."),reward="Reward varies by quest/build; exact values should be taken from the current in-game dialogue or source page.",warnings="Do not kill neutral or named NPCs involved in the investigation until you have exhausted their dialogue; New Balance often uses them in follow-up quests.",searchTags=listOf("missing in action","valley of mines - castle","local quest giver in valley of mines - castle","garond")),
        Quest("CH2-151",2,151,"Food for the Paladins in the Castle",category="Valley of Mines - Castle",giver="Garond",location="Valley of Mines - Castle",prerequisites="Chapter 2; complete earlier quests in the same area/faction if the dialogue is not yet available.",summary="Deliver food supplies for the castle's paladins.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Ask Garond about the food shortage.","Gather 50 pieces of raw meat and 50 fish.","Deliver the supplies to Garond."),reward="Reward varies by quest/build; exact values should be taken from the current in-game dialogue or source page.",warnings="Do not sell unique named items, special ingredients, quest letters or unusual trophies until the related quest chain is finished.",searchTags=listOf("food for the paladins in the castle","valley of mines - castle","local quest giver in valley of mines - castle","garond")),
        Quest("CH2-152",2,152,"Tactical Advantage",category="Valley of Mines - Castle",giver="Parcival",location="Valley of Mines - Castle",prerequisites="Chapter 2; complete earlier quests in the same area/faction if the dialogue is not yet available.",summary="Eliminate the orc crossbowmen, warriors and leader occupying the cliff.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Accept Parcival's assignment at Garond's castle.","Clear the orc crossbowmen, fighters and leader on the nearby cliff.","Search the cave where the leader and a spider may be hiding, if the quest does not complete.","Return to Parcival for the reward."),reward="Reward varies by quest/build; exact values should be taken from the current in-game dialogue or source page.",warnings="If the journal does not update, leave the area and revisit all cliff positions, including the cave.",searchTags=listOf("tactical advantage","valley of mines - castle","local quest giver in valley of mines - castle","parcival")),
        Quest("CH2-153",2,153,"Secrets of the Temple of Adanos",category="Valley of Ashtar / Plateau of the Ancients",giver="Ancient tablet in the Temple of Adanos (automatic)",location="Valley of Ashtar / Plateau of the Ancients",prerequisites="Raven has vanished during the Temple of Adanos confrontation; take and read the ancient tablet from the secret room.",summary="Use Raven's ancient tablet and the Sun Key to reach the Plateau of the Ancients, complete Adanos's trials, and eventually defeat Raven.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("After Raven's disappearance, enter the hidden portal chamber and collect the ancient tablet, stone crystal (Sun Key), and Summon Stone Guardian rune.","Read the tablet, consult Saturas, and place the stone crystal on the pyramid pedestal to activate a teleporter.","Defeat the stone puma, retrieve the focus stone, activate the next teleporter and meet the golden dragon Ash'Tar.","Charge the ancient tablet at the runic altar in the Scholars' Library using the summoning rune.","Return to the Temple of Adanos, summon the ancient guardian, then acquire the guardian-defeating weapon from the Warriors' Temple.","Defeat the guardian, take its runic heart and use the heart on the magic sphere in the Scholars' Library to open the Plateau of the Ancients.","Gather four oasis keys and tablet fragments, explore the Tears shrine, defeat its guardians and the Titan, and assemble the rune tablet.","Pass the trials in the Temple of Truth, restore the Tree of Life, and obtain the Crown of Ice.","Wear the crown and Scepter of Adanos at the altar, cross the bridge to Adanar, and defeat Raven in his Nightmare instance.","Report the final victory to Adanar, Saturas and Ash'Tar."),reward="Reward varies by quest/build; exact values should be taken from the current in-game dialogue or source page.",warnings="This chain continues into later/high-level areas; not all objectives are recommended for Chapter 2. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/tajny-xrama-adanosa.67352/ (April 2026).",searchTags=listOf("secrets of the temple of adanos","valley of ashtar / plateau of the ancients","local quest giver in valley of ashtar / plateau of the ancients")),
        Quest("CH2-154",2,154,"Raven's Nightmare",category="Valley of Ashtar / Plateau of the Ancients",giver="Raven",location="Valley of Ashtar / Plateau of the Ancients",prerequisites="Reach the ruined valley behind the Desert of Adanos and meet the challenge requirements; make a separate save.",summary="Enter Raven's nightmare through the conversation with him beyond the Desert of Adanos.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Complete the Desert of Adanos progression and reach the valley with the temple beyond the main pyramid.","Speak with Raven opposite the temple entrance to enter Raven's Nightmare.","Follow the cliffside and defeat the lizardman boss, activating the wall button and switch.","Cross the bridge after speaking to the spirit, clear the cemetery and progress through the successive boss battles and switches.","Use the nearby Meatbug Transformation scroll to crawl through a gap, defeat the Dark Guardian and the mage boss, and continue through the final chambers.","Complete the entire nightmare before attempting to leave; return to the main story afterward."),reward="Reward varies by quest/build; exact values should be taken from the current in-game dialogue or source page.",warnings="This is a difficult, one-way instance until completed. Community guide recommends at least 2000 health and 250 strength/dexterity or 500 mana.",searchTags=listOf("raven's nightmare","valley of ashtar / plateau of the ancients","local quest giver in valley of ashtar / plateau of the ancients")),
        Quest("CH2-155",2,155,"Artifacts of Antiquity",category="Valley of Ashtar / Plateau of the Ancients",giver="Saturas",location="Valley of Ashtar / Plateau of the Ancients",prerequisites="Carry the Sun Key stone crystal found after Raven vanishes, then discuss it with Saturas.",summary="Follow Ash'Tar's explanation of the Claw of Beliar and decide how to deal with the archdemon S'Enyak.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Collect the Sun Key after Raven vanishes and show it to Saturas.","Advance Secrets of the Temple of Adanos, find the golden dragon Ash'Tar and discuss the Claw of Beliar's imprisoned archdemon.","Defeat Raven in Raven's Nightmare and recover the Claw; show it to Ash'Tar.","Choose whether to destroy the Claw for experience and learning points, or preserve it for the demon-soul route.","If keeping it, either collect four elemental spheres to create Cross of Elements and kill S'Enyak, or learn Mora Ulartu through Xardas/Kreol and obtain the Triramar amulet.","Summon S'Enyak with Ash'Tar's horn and resolve the chosen demon route.","If the soul is captured, consult Xardas or Kreol and strengthen the Claw at a Beliar shrine."),reward="Reward varies by quest/build; exact values should be taken from the current in-game dialogue or source page.",warnings="Decisions are mutually exclusive. Destroying the Claw prevents Mora Ulartu. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/artefakty-drevnosti.67354/ (updated May 2026).",searchTags=listOf("artifacts of antiquity","valley of ashtar / plateau of the ancients","local quest giver in valley of ashtar / plateau of the ancients")),
